-- About 750 more foods: chains and street food, sport products, packaged Turkish market products and more
-- home cooking. Values are per 100 g like the rest of the catalog (chain items converted from their
-- published or typical per-item values); carbohydrate follows EU labels, so fibre is not counted in it.
-- New categories: fastfood (chains), supplement (sport products) and packaged (market products).
-- A name that is already in the catalog is skipped, so a hand-added row never makes this fail.
